    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This is an excellent opportunity to acquire a three-bedroom end-of-terrace residence in this convenient location in Bayside. Situated close to the Howth Road entrance to Bayside with a few minutes’ walk of the new shopping centre amenity, this property offers great potential for those seeking to create a comfortable family home in Sutton.\r\nExtending to approximately 86.6 sq.m. (932 sq.ft.), the accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall, spacious living room, separate dining room and a galley kitchen/breakfast room at ground floor level. Upstairs there are three bedrooms, including a principal bedroom with en-suite, together with a family bathroom.\r\nThe property is a little dated by modern standards and requires modernisation and refurbishment, presenting purchasers with an opportunity to renovate and finish their new home to their own individual taste and specification. \r\n\r\nThere is also a generous sized garage included in the sale.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none. Bayside Dart station is within a short stroll, providing excellent access to the city centre, while the recently finished Bayside Shopping Centre caters for all day-to-day shopping requirements, along with providing a choice of good restaurants and café amenities. \r\nThe stunning seafront promenade, coastal walks and cycleways are all close by, with nearby Sutton, Howth and St. Anne's Park offering an abundance of recreational amenities. The area is exceptionally well served by both primary and secondary schools, making it an ideal choice for young families, first time buyers and downsizers seeking a settled neighbourhood community. \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended by appointment with Gallagher Quigley."
      },
